sections.content:
In this Sanhita, unless the context otherwise requires,—
(1) 'child' means any person below the age of eighteen years;
(2) 'court' means a Judge who is empowered by law to act judicially;
(3) 'document' means any matter expressed or described upon any substance by means of letters, figures or marks, including electronic and digital records.

